        "id": "2121656933002408008",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Robin Ebers",
        "text": "Grok Bot is the only one that stuck\n\nChatGPT Dots: i’ve literally paused mine due to bugs and constant refusals or annoying prompts to approve. Plus no independent app. \n\nClaude Duet: was excited, didn’t do much at all, way too early hope probably the sleeper",
